!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Start by receiving the invoice;
:Check the invoice for any mismatches;
:v1: Check the invoice for any mismatches ({re-send the invoice to the customer, post the invoice, block the invoice}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v1 = 're-send the invoice to the customer'])
:Is re-send the invoice to the customer needed;
:Continue process after re-sending invoice;
case ([v1 = 'post the invoice'])
:Is option to post the invoice;
:Continue process after posting invoice;
case ([v1 = 'block the invoice'])
:Is option to block the invoice;
:Continue process after blocking invoice;
endswitch
:Park the invoice;
:End process;
stop
